  "body": "_⚠️ Potential issue_ | _🟠 Major_ | _⚡ Quick win_\n\n**`<img>` 태그에 `alt` 속성이 누락되었습니다 — 접근성 위반**\n\n브랜드 로고 이미지는 카드 브랜드를 전달하는 정보성 이미지이므로, `alt`가 없으면 스크린 리더가 파일명(예: `\"masterLogo.png\"`)을 그대로 읽어줍니다. WCAG 2.1 SC 1.1.1(Non-text Content) 위반입니다.\n\n<details>\n<summary>🛡️ 수정 제안</summary>\n\n```diff\n  <img\n    css={css`\n      width: 36px;\n      height: 22px;\n    `}\n    src={cardInfo.brand === \"master\" ? masterLogo : visaLogo}\n+   alt={cardInfo.brand === \"master\" ? \"MasterCard\" : \"Visa\"}\n  />\n```\n</details>\n\n<!-- suggestion_start -->\n\n<details>\n<summary>📝 Committable suggestion</summary>\n\n> ‼️ **IMPORTANT**\n> Carefully review the code before committing. Ensure that it accurately replaces the highlighted code, contains no missing lines, and has no issues with indentation. Thoroughly test & benchmark the code to ensure it meets the requirements.\n\n```suggestion\n        {cardInfo.brand && (\n          <img\n            css={css`\n              width: 36px;\n              height: 22px;\n            `}\n            src={cardInfo.brand === \"master\" ? masterLogo : visaLogo}\n            alt={cardInfo.brand === \"master\" ? \"MasterCard\" : \"Visa\"}\n          />\n        )}\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- suggestion_end -->\n\n<details>\n<summary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>\n\n```\nVerify each finding against the current code and only fix it if needed.\n\nIn `@my-app/src/components/Card/Card.tsx` around lines 47 - 55, Add an accessible\nalt attribute to the brand image in the Card component so screen readers get\ndescriptive text: in the JSX block that renders <img> (referencing\ncardInfo.brand, masterLogo, visaLogo) set alt to a meaningful string derived\nfrom cardInfo.brand (e.g., \"Mastercard\" when cardInfo.brand === \"master\", \"Visa\"\nfor \"visa\", or `${cardInfo.brand} logo` as a safe fallback) and ensure the alt\nvalue is always present when the image is rendered.\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- fingerprinting:phantom:poseidon:churro:c09b78ef-93c9-4f69-abc8-a81fe1768067 -->\n\n<!-- 4e71b3a2 -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment by CodeRabbit -->",
