  "path": "my-app/src/components/InputSectionLayout/InputSectionLayout.tsx",
  "line": null,
  "body": "_⚠️ Potential issue_ | _🟠 Major_ | _⚡ Quick win_\n\n**`<label>` 접근성 연결 누락 — `<fieldset>`/`<legend>` 패턴 권장**\n\n`<label>`에 `htmlFor`가 없고 입력 요소를 감싸지도 않아, 스크린 리더가 이 레이블을 어떤 입력 필드와도 연결하지 못합니다. 특히 카드 번호(4개)·유효기간(2개)처럼 입력이 여러 개인 섹션에서는 단순 `htmlFor`로는 전체 그룹을 표현할 수 없으므로, `<fieldset>` + `<legend>` 패턴이 적합합니다.\n\n<details>\n<summary>♿ 권장 구조 (레이아웃 하단 wrapper 변경)</summary>\n\n```diff\n-      <div\n-        css={css`\n-          display: flex;\n-          flex-direction: column;\n-          gap: 8px;\n-        `}\n-      >\n-        {/* 카드번호*/}\n-        <label\n-          css={css`\n-            font-size: 12px;\n-            font-weight: 500;\n-            line-height: 15px;\n-            color: `#0a0d13`;\n-          `}\n-        >\n-          {tag}\n-        </label>\n-        {children}\n-      </div>\n+      <fieldset\n+        css={css`\n+          display: flex;\n+          flex-direction: column;\n+          gap: 8px;\n+          border: none;\n+          padding: 0;\n+          margin: 0;\n+        `}\n+      >\n+        <legend\n+          css={css`\n+            font-size: 12px;\n+            font-weight: 500;\n+            line-height: 15px;\n+            color: `#0a0d13`;\n+          `}\n+        >\n+          {tag}\n+        </legend>\n+        {children}\n+      </fieldset>\n```\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>\n\n```\nVerify each finding against the current code and only fix it if needed.\n\nIn `@my-app/src/components/InputSectionLayout/InputSectionLayout.tsx` around lines\n62 - 71, The <label> currently rendered in the InputSectionLayout component (the\nJSX that uses {tag}) is not associated with any input; replace this label with\nan accessible field group: wrap the section’s children in a <fieldset> and\nrender the tag text as a <legend> (preserving the existing css styling applied\nto the label) so screen readers can associate the group of inputs (e.g.,\nmultiple card-number or expiry inputs) with the legend; if any individual input\nstill needs a label, ensure those inputs have their own <label htmlFor=\"...\"> or\naria-label as appropriate.\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- fingerprinting:phantom:poseidon:churro:13edcab6-1469-42b6-a1db-8508fe2987fd -->\n\n<!-- 4e71b3a2 -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment by CodeRabbit -->",
