  "body": "_⚠️ Potential issue_ | _🟡 Minor_ | _⚡ Quick win_\n\n**`<section>` 대신 `<div>` 사용 권장**\n\n`<section>`은 ARIA 랜드마크 역할(`region`)을 가지며, 보조 기술은 접근 가능한 이름이 없는 `<section>`을 비효율적으로 처리하거나 무시합니다. 입력 요소를 그루핑하는 용도라면 `<div>`(의미 없는 그루핑) 또는 `<fieldset>`(폼 컨트롤 그루핑의 네이티브 방법)이 적합합니다.\n\n<details>\n<summary>♿ 권장 수정</summary>\n\n```diff\n-      <section\n+      <div\n        css={css`\n          display: flex;\n          flex-direction: row;\n          gap: 8px;\n        `}\n      >\n        {/* inputs */}\n-      </section>\n+      </div>\n```\n</details>\n\n<!-- suggestion_start -->\n\n<details>\n<summary>📝 Committable suggestion</summary>\n\n> ‼️ **IMPORTANT**\n> Carefully review the code before committing. Ensure that it accurately replaces the highlighted code, contains no missing lines, and has no issues with indentation. Thoroughly test & benchmark the code to ensure it meets the requirements.\n\n```suggestion\n      <div\n        css={css`\n          display: flex;\n          flex-direction: row;\n          gap: 8px;\n        `}\n      >\n        {Array.from({ length: inputOption.count }).map((_, i) => (\n          <input\n            key={i}\n            maxLength={inputOption.maxLength}\n            value={values[i] || \"\"}\n            onChange={(e) => onChange(i, e.target.value)}\n            onBlur={() => onBlur(i)}\n            css={css`\n              flex: 1;\n              height: 32px;\n              border-radius: 2px;\n              min-width: 0;\n              border: 1.01px solid ${errorIndex === i ? \"#ff3d3d\" : \"#ACACAC\"};\n              padding: 8px;\n              box-sizing: border-box;\n            `}\n            placeholder={inputOption.placeHolder[i]}\n          />\n        ))}\n      </div>\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- suggestion_end -->\n\n<details>\n<summary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>\n\n```\nVerify each finding against the current code and only fix it if needed.\n\nIn `@my-app/src/components/ValidatedInputGroup/ValidatedInputGroup.tsx` around\nlines 39 - 65, The markup uses a semantic <section> to wrap input elements which\ncan create ARIA/assistive-tech issues; update the ValidatedInputGroup component\nto replace the <section> wrapper with a non-landmark <div> (or <fieldset> if you\nwant native form grouping) keeping the same css prop and children mapping logic;\nensure the css={css`...`} and all child input attributes (key, maxLength, value,\nonChange, onBlur, placeholder) remain unchanged and that the wrapper element\nname is updated wherever the JSX uses <section> inside ValidatedInputGroup so\nrendering and styling are preserved.\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- fingerprinting:phantom:poseidon:churro:13edcab6-1469-42b6-a1db-8508fe2987fd -->\n\n<!-- d98c2f50 -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment by CodeRabbit -->",
